<title>USA: Claire Technologies to sell Hyperflow.</title>
<headline>Claire Technologies to sell Hyperflow.</headline>
<dateline>SCOTTSDALE, Ariz. 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Claire Technologies Inc said its board has determined that it is in the best interest of shareholders of Claire to market the unprofitable Hyperflow Technologies Inc for sale.</p>
<p>Hyperflow is a 70 percent equity-controlled subsidiary of the company. Claire, an investment holding company, has recently been investigating other possible acquisitions or mergers, the company said.</p>
